GloVe: Global Vectors for Word Representation
Jeffrey Pennington, Richard Socher and Christopher D. Manning, Stanford University, 2014.
https://nlp.stanford.edu/projects/glove/

The pre-trained word vectors are made available under the Open Data Commons Public Domain Dedication
and License (PDDL) v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/pddl/1-0/

The files in this folder are a cut-down copy (6,036 frequent words, rounded to whole numbers with one
scale per word) of the "glove.6B.50d" vectors, trained on Wikipedia 2014 and Gigaword 5.
